Description:It is your first main phase. You control no creatures and have Act of Treason and Twincast in hand, with three red and two blue mana floating. The opponent is at 6 life and controls two untapped Hill Giants. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-copy-new-targets | A copy of a spell may be given new targets when the copying effect says so (CR 707.10c): cast Act of Treason on one Hill Giant, Twincast it and point the copy at the other Giant, then attack with both for 6 and nothing left to block; a copy keeping the original target steals only one Giant, and the other blocks
